WEBVTT

01:30.350 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.340 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 34]

01:44.479 --> 01:46.430
After being busy for over half a month,

01:46.430 --> 01:47.920
I can finally relax a bit

01:48.759 --> 01:51.289
and have some time to check on
our pine forest.

01:54.560 --> 01:56.400
If this pine forest

01:56.400 --> 01:58.350
can survive its first winter,

01:58.710 --> 01:59.840
next spring,

02:00.200 --> 02:01.760
we'll plant some new saplings.

02:01.760 --> 02:02.760
In 2 or 3 years,

02:02.870 --> 02:05.130
it will be a completely different scene.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.000
Look.

02:07.430 --> 02:09.889
The 2 little pine trees
we picked are so cute.

02:10.560 --> 02:11.840
I can already imagine

02:11.940 --> 02:12.940
that one day,

02:13.080 --> 02:14.630
when our hair is all white,

02:14.870 --> 02:16.560
they'll be

02:16.630 --> 02:18.360
20 or 30 chi tall.

02:21.750 --> 02:23.150
I'm talking to you.

02:23.200 --> 02:25.200
Why are you so absent-minded today?

02:25.360 --> 02:26.190
I'm not.

02:27.840 --> 02:28.640
You're tired?

02:29.430 --> 02:31.290
How could I be tired when I see you?

02:32.520 --> 02:34.910
It's just that
when I left the city a while ago,

02:34.910 --> 02:37.640
seeing the bodies of starving people
everywhere

02:37.960 --> 02:39.280
made me a bit sad.

02:41.870 --> 02:45.200
In the past, when I was
fighting enemies on the battlefield,

02:45.430 --> 02:47.030
I never thought about death,

02:47.750 --> 02:49.240
nor was I ever afraid of it.

02:50.710 --> 02:51.590
Because

02:52.310 --> 02:55.310
there probably wouldn't be anyone
to collect my body.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.430
So I thought,

02:57.800 --> 02:58.800
wherever I fall,

02:59.910 --> 03:02.170
just burying me on the spot would be fine.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.080
But now,

03:09.080 --> 03:10.610
ever since I came to Huizhou

03:11.960 --> 03:13.000
and met you...

03:18.190 --> 03:20.920
Death is no longer something
I can face so easily.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.360
Death? Bah!

03:23.590 --> 03:25.190
Stop saying such depressing things.

03:25.190 --> 03:27.250
Aren't we living perfectly fine now?

03:27.590 --> 03:29.240
We still have a long life ahead of us.

03:29.240 --> 03:31.240
We must cherish the days we have now.

03:32.680 --> 03:33.590
Before that,

03:33.590 --> 03:35.520
you still have a lot of things to do.

03:35.960 --> 03:36.590
Look.

03:36.750 --> 03:37.910
Every year, Li Ink

03:37.910 --> 03:40.360
has to open a new ink shop in a new place,
right?

03:40.360 --> 03:41.960
You have to be with me, right?

03:42.030 --> 03:43.590
And we need to take part in the

03:43.590 --> 03:45.470
Tribute Ink selection together
4 years from now.

03:45.470 --> 03:46.910
And looking at the near future,

03:46.910 --> 03:49.440
when the ink workshop
takes a break next year,

03:49.560 --> 03:50.960
I want to go see the ocean.

03:51.079 --> 03:52.150
At that time,

03:52.280 --> 03:54.140
you definitely have to go with me.

03:57.870 --> 04:00.000
Why do you keep looking at me like that?

04:01.870 --> 04:02.930
You are beautiful.

04:04.430 --> 04:05.830
I want to look at you more.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.540
You're being silly again.

04:10.150 --> 04:12.960
What I just said was all a joke.

04:14.000 --> 04:14.800
However,

04:15.840 --> 04:17.680
if an accident ever happens to me one day,

04:17.680 --> 04:19.430
you must remember to bury me

04:19.510 --> 04:21.839
under the pine trees we planted together.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.120
Here you go again.

04:25.190 --> 04:27.390
Saying these depressing things again.

04:28.910 --> 04:30.610
I don't like these jokes of yours.

04:30.610 --> 04:32.409
Don't say it again in the future.

04:38.190 --> 04:39.600
We still have

04:40.190 --> 04:41.480
a long life ahead of us.

04:41.870 --> 04:42.870
We must

04:43.510 --> 04:45.170
take our time living our days.
